{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In 1970, Soviet scientists began drilling deep into the Earth. By 1983, they reached 12,000 meters\u2014</strong><br><strong>but at 14,000 meters, they uncovered something that was never meant to be found.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange portal lay buried beneath the surface. When a probe was sent in, hell itself answered. Monstrous creatures poured out, tearing through the facility and spreading beyond Soviet borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the USSR tried to bury the truth. But as the world collapsed into chaos, they had no choice but to call for a global response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>MAMA</strong>\u2014an elite unit of highly trained female operatives, deployed to hunt the creatures, contain the outbreak, and uncover the portal\u2019s true origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is on the brink. The hunt begins.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic RPG Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage deadly enemies using your equipment, items, and tactical choices in high-risk missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209850/extras/b6d0bce03fd7fec6128a2362df2905ca.poster.avif?t=1773158175\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209850/extras/b6d0bce03fd7fec6128a2362df2905ca.webm?t=1773158175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209850/extras/b6d0bce03fd7fec6128a2362df2905ca.mp4?t=1773158175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Operative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a lineup of irresistible married agents\u2014each ready to in